WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:04.480
So let's now go to another interesting interview
that Barack Obama did over the weekend.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.979
Barack Obama was interviewed with 60 Minutes.

00:00:07.979 --> 00:00:11.140
It was crazy, just like Trump.

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:17.550
Former President Obama walked out of the interview
abruptly as soon as he was asked the real

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.680
question.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:19.680
I'm kidding.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.680
Obviously, he didn't do that.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:26.421
Unlike Donald Trump, who did do that a few
weeks ago, Barack Obama sat there and just

00:00:26.421 --> 00:00:28.470
answered the questions he was asked.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:32.850
We might not like every answer he gave, but
he just answered the questions.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.149
Unlike Donald Trump, who had to abort the
interview and walk out on Leslie Stahl.

00:00:37.149 --> 00:00:40.050
But I have some clips I do want to look at
with you.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:44.730
And what I found fascinating about this interview
is that Barack Obama is talking about Trump

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:49.680
as if he's a problem child who misbehaves
and he's sort of struggling to deal with a

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:50.680
child.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:56.110
It reminded me of a second grade teacher explaining
to the parents that, listen, what what little

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.180
Donny is doing in class.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.310
It's not OK.

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:03.170
But I need to talk to you about what's going
on at home to really have a chance at fixing

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.170
it.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.450
It felt like that type of a conversation.

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:11.430
Let's take a look at a little little bit of
it and then discuss what are these false claims

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:17.720
of widespread election fraud doing to our
country right now, the president doesn't like

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:22.180
to lose and never admits loss.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:28.450
I'm more troubled by the fact that other Republican
officials who clearly know better are going

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:32.820
along with this are humoring him in this fashion.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:36.700
Little Donny doesn't like to lose or admit
he lost.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.910
But President Obama pointing out, as I've
been doing for some time now, that the problem

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.520
is not Trump alone.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:49.130
It's Republicans around Trump and voters in
this case.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:55.290
Because if every Republican simply said, Don,
come on, Joe Biden won Joe Biden's president

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:57.460
elect, you've got to move on.

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:01.790
We would have a very different scenario if
right wing media did the same, this wouldn't

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:07.530
now be dragging out into what is almost week
three at this point in time with 86 percent

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:11.560
of Trump assets believing Joe Biden didn't
legitimately win.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.060
And we'll talk about this.

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.450
The idea here is the problem isn't really
Trump.

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.320
The problem is the Republican Party.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.520
You could have a Trump.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.660
If Trump tried to run as a Democrat, it would
have gone nowhere.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.440
Trump ran as a Republican.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:27.520
And I'm not going back to that debunked quote
that that's not even a real quote from Trump

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:28.720
from 20 years ago.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:32.090
The reason Trump became president is because
he ran as a Republican.

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:34.570
It wouldn't have worked in the Democratic
Party.

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:37.170
And the problem is Republicans to a great
degree.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.340
And we will talk about that.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.210
But let's continue with this interview.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:47.181
It is one more step in delegitimizing not
just the incoming Biden administration, but

00:02:47.181 --> 00:02:49.520
democracy generally.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.320
And that's a dangerous path.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:57.250
We would never accept that out of our own
kids behaving that way if they lost.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:08.100
I mean, if my daughters and any kind of competition
pouted and then accused the other side of

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:12.069
cheating when they lost, when there was no
evidence of it, we'd scold them.

00:03:12.069 --> 00:03:13.069
This is just perfect.

00:03:13.069 --> 00:03:15.069
And I'd actually go further.

00:03:15.069 --> 00:03:19.950
It's not just children that get scolded for
acting the way Trump is acting.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.620
Trump is acting like a child.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:24.620
I've played in sports leagues as an adult.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.830
I've played in soccer leagues.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.040
I've played in dodgeball.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:31.100
We had a huge dodgeball performance where
The David Pakman Show charity dodgeball team

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.400
won the tournament.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.350
But imagine we had lost.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:38.600
And imagine that we started saying the refs
rigged it.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.040
We actually won.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:46.500
I mean, even adults who behave this way in
any kind of competitive event would be asked

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.500
to leave.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.740
And that is what Donald Trump is doing.

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:54.440
And then Barack Obama also pointed out that
there's been huge normalization of insanity

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.890
in the last few years.

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:58.670
And he likens Trump to a strongman dictator.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:03.060
You know, I think that there has been.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:11.099
This sense over the last several years that
literally anything goes and is justified in

00:04:11.099 --> 00:04:17.989
order to get power and, you know, that's not
unique to the United States.

00:04:17.989 --> 00:04:23.690
There are strongmen and dictators around the
world who think that I can do anything to

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.910
stay in power.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:33.260
I can kill people, I can throw them in jail,
I can run phony elections, I can suppress

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:37.240
journalists.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:40.480
But that's not who we're supposed to be.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:48.360
And one of the signals, I think, that Joe
Biden needs to send to the world is that,

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:57.200
no, those values that we preached and we believed
in and subscribed in, we still believe now,

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:03.130
literally, as this interview is wrapping up
on 60 Minutes, Donald Trump took to Twitter

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:09.640
and tweeted this humiliating screed, quote,
Why does the fake news media continuously

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:13.500
assume that Joe Biden will ascend to the presidency?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:19.650
Not even allowing our side to show which we
are just getting ready to do, how badly shattered

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:24.240
and violated our great constitution has been
in the twenty twenty election.

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:28.850
It was attacked, perhaps like never before,
from large numbers of poll watchers that were

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:33.290
thrown out of vote counting rooms in many
of our states to millions of ballots that

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:40.070
have been altered by Democrats only for Democrats
to voting after the election was over to using

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:46.220
radical left owned Dominion voting systems
turned down by Texas and many others because

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:48.480
it was not good or secure.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:53.330
Those responsible for the safeguarding of
our Constitution cannot allow the fake results

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.340
of the 2020 mail in election to stand.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.340
The world is watching completely humiliating.

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:04.030
I mean, it's we're going to go through the
lies in that in the next segment.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:11.150
But this is a humiliating tragedy that the
United States is going through right now.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:16.600
We all we can do is put one foot in front
of the other one day at a time and get to

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.720
January 20th.

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:22.750
We really can't do anything else at this point.

